<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="proposed" name="Figure 9 - Process Flow of the Proposed System"><mxGraphModel dx="1380" dy="1120" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1380" pageHeight="1120" adaptiveColors="auto"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="figure-title" value="FIGURE 9. PROCESS FLOW OF THE PROPOSED SYSTEM" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=24;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=none;spacing=8;text;strokeColor=none;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="18" width="1300" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="figure-status" value="Example workflow; staff choose which action is needed" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=none;spacing=8;text;strokeColor=none;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="64" width="1300" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="signin" value="1. Sign in&#xa;Use an approved staff account" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;rounded=1;arcSize=45;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="125" width="400" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="child" value="2. Find or add the child&#xa;Review records and appointments" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="275" width="400" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dose" value="3. Record the vaccine given&#xa;Enter the dose and date&#xa;Check that it is not repeated" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="425" width="400" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="appointment" value="4. Set the next appointment&#xa;Wednesday is the regular day&#xa;Write a reason for another day" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="605" width="400" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="monitor" value="5. Review appointments&#xa;Check due or past dates&#xa;Record follow-up actions" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="790" width="400" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="remind" value="6. Prepare a reminder if needed&#xa;Check the guardian and message&#xa;Demo: no real text is sent" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="785" y="785" width="470" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="outcome" value="7. Check the reminder result&#xa;Review the logged outcome&#xa;Demo does not confirm delivery" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="785" y="600" width="470" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="report" value="View reports or print&#xa;Available without sending a text" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="785" y="425" width="470" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="clinical" value="OPTIONAL RECORD REVIEW&#xa;Choose a record; check its dates&#xa;Run the experimental review&#xa;Staff review any flagged pattern&#xa;This is not a health assessment" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="785" y="125" width="470" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="holiday" value="HOLIDAYS: staff choose another clinic date, such as Thursday, and record the reason." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="980" width="1155" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-0" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="signin" target="child"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="300" y="210" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="300" y="275" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="child" target="dose"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="300" y="360" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="300" y="425" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-2" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="dose" target="appointment"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="300" y="540" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="300" y="605" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-3" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;lab